        "review_NdggfY": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I'm huge into cologne so I'm a picky guy when it comes to clones, but TryScent completely won me over. I originally ordered the Sauvage clone on the homepage and instantly recognized the scent when spraying. I now own 4 TryScent fragrances total and I love them all. Got 3 more on the way thanks to their bundle deals. If u want something that works on a budget and delivers designer performance I couldn't recommend them more.\"</p>",
